<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: A wall of rough fieldstones set in mortar. Cheaper and quicker to build than a proper stone wall, but it does not hold up as well. -->
  <CBF_MO_CobbleWall.description>用砂漿砌起粗糙田野石塊的牆。比正規石牆便宜、蓋得快，但沒那麼耐用。</CBF_MO_CobbleWall.description>
  <!-- EN: rubble stone wall -->
  <CBF_MO_CobbleWall.label>毛石牆</CBF_MO_CobbleWall.label>
